WEBVTT

00:04.820 --> 00:07.820
<b>I wasn’t expecting to find 
 an accessory shop there!</b>

00:09.700 --> 00:12.780
<b>Who would’ve thought 
 she’d take an hour to pick something...</b>

00:12.780 --> 00:14.740
<b>I fell asleep for a bit.</b>

00:14.740 --> 00:16.830
<b>What do you think, Pikachu?</b>

00:17.750 --> 00:20.080
<b>It looks good on me?</b>

00:20.670 --> 00:22.590
<b>How about you two?{her mouth doesn't move... - check Amazon at batching time incase it gets reanimated}</b>

00:20.670 --> 00:25.340
<b>Accompanied by a merry Kasumi, Satoshi and friends 
 arrive at a town bathed in an evening glow.</b>

00:25.340 --> 00:27.220
<b>It appears they’ll be staying here tonight.</b>

00:27.220 --> 00:31.140
<b>Let’s see... 
 The Pokémon Center will be...</b>

00:32.550 --> 00:34.390
<b>What was that scream?</b>

00:34.390 --> 00:35.310
<b>Let’s check it out.</b>

00:35.310 --> 00:36.020
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:37.810 --> 00:38.980
<b>Over there!</b>

00:40.060 --> 00:41.810
<b>Ms. Junsa!</b>

00:41.810 --> 00:43.150
<b>It happened again?</b>

00:43.150 --> 00:44.940
<b>Put your mind at ease!</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:47.650
<b>You have nothing to fear 
 now that I’ve arrived.</b>

00:47.650 --> 00:49.820
<b>I will exhaust every effort 
 to aid yo—Gah!</b>

00:50.530 --> 00:52.700
<b>Okay, okay, 
 you’re getting us nowhere.</b>

00:52.700 --> 00:54.030
<b>I shall be back...</b>

00:56.160 --> 00:58.620
<b>Ms. Junsa, did something happen?</b>

00:59.080 --> 01:03.630
<b>Well, there’s been a strange phenomenon 
 occurring in houses all over lately.</b>

01:03.630 --> 01:07.800
<b>I believe a Pokémon’s behind it, 
 but don’t know who.</b>

01:07.800 --> 01:09.760
<b>A strange phenomenon?</b>

01:09.760 --> 01:11.840
<b>I have to investigate and stop it.</b>

01:11.840 --> 01:13.260
<b>Let’s go, Guardie.</b>

01:14.140 --> 01:16.010
<b>In that case...</b>

01:16.010 --> 01:17.140
<b>Gänger!</b>

01:21.480 --> 01:23.190
<b>We’ll help you!</b>

