02:56.490 --> 03:01.910
Jupetta's Search!

02:56.490 --> 03:01.910
Jupetta's Search!

02:56.490 --> 03:01.910
Jupetta's Search!

03:11.880 --> 03:13.550
<b>Let’s split up and look around.</b>

03:13.550 --> 03:14.720
<b>Right.</b>

03:26.060 --> 03:28.520
<b>Guardie, smell something?</b>

03:33.650 --> 03:35.240
<b>Ms. Junsa, behind you!</b>

03:47.370 --> 03:49.500
<b>Gänger, use Shadow Ball!</b>

03:54.510 --> 03:56.840
<b>Don’t let it get away, Pikachu! 
 Electroweb!</b>

04:01.800 --> 04:03.560
<b>A Jupetta?!</b>

04:09.310 --> 04:12.190
<b>I’ve figured it out! 
 It’s a Jupetta.</b>

04:12.190 --> 04:13.480
<b>Jupetta?</b>

04:13.480 --> 04:15.740
<b>But why would it do this...?</b>

04:16.990 --> 04:18.200
<b>Over there!</b>

04:18.820 --> 04:20.030
<b>Excuse us!</b>

04:23.410 --> 04:24.910
<b>There it is!</b>

04:24.910 --> 04:26.870
<b>H— Wait!</b>

04:28.250 --> 04:29.170
<b>Over there!</b>

04:38.550 --> 04:43.220
<b>Apparently Jupetta has been taking various items 
 from the houses it’s invaded.</b>

04:43.220 --> 04:44.760
<b>Like what?</b>

04:44.760 --> 04:46.600
<b>For example, a cushion.</b>

04:46.600 --> 04:47.680
<b>A cushion?</b>

04:47.680 --> 04:50.230
<b>Yes. A heart-shaped one.</b>

04:50.230 --> 04:54.070
<b>Plus, a heart-shaped mirror, 
 heart-shaped sunglasses,</b>

04:54.070 --> 04:58.030
<b>a heart balloon, heart chocolate, 
 and an ace of hearts.</b>

04:58.030 --> 05:00.280
<b>Huh? They’re all hearts?</b>

05:00.280 --> 05:05.540
<b>Right. The taken items have one thing in common; 
 they’re all heart-shaped.</b>

05:05.540 --> 05:07.370
<b>Why hearts?</b>

05:07.370 --> 05:09.330
<b>Hmm...</b>

06:00.670 --> 06:04.470
<b>It looks great on you, 
 Gon-chan!</b>

06:16.980 --> 06:20.320
<b>Jupetta. Plush Doll Pokémon. 
 Ghost type.</b>

06:20.690 --> 06:24.660
<b>A doll given life as a Pokémon 
 by its grudge from being abandoned.{based on DP dex entry}</b>

06:24.660 --> 06:26.950
<b>An abandoned doll...</b>

06:26.950 --> 06:28.830
<b>Poor thing...</b>

06:30.830 --> 06:34.750
<b>So is it harassing people 
 because of that grudge?{NEPish but slightly rephrased}</b>

06:34.750 --> 06:37.460
<b>But why is it <i>only</i> taking 
 heart-shaped things?</b>

06:37.460 --> 06:40.590
<b>I wanna know more 
 about that Jupetta!</b>

06:43.090 --> 06:46.800
<b>All right! 
 Let’s go look for it again!</b>

06:49.640 --> 06:51.310
<b>We’re all hungry...</b>

06:51.310 --> 06:54.100
<b>We haven’t eaten anything 
 since midday.</b>

06:55.730 --> 06:57.860
<b>Oh, is that so?</b>

06:58.270 --> 07:00.440
<b>I’ll have to {original: improve the}increase security...</b>

07:00.440 --> 07:01.570
<b>Ms. Joy!</b>

07:01.570 --> 07:03.740
<b>Your security is here.</b>

07:03.740 --> 07:07.660
<b>Your heart’s worries are the key to unlock 
 my blazing flames of love—{NEPish but different wording}</b>

07:14.540 --> 07:16.120
<b>I shall be back!</b>

07:16.120 --> 07:18.500
<b>Let’s go to the cafeteria already.</b>

07:40.440 --> 07:42.440
<b>All right! 
 I’m full of energy!</b>

07:42.440 --> 07:44.820
<b>I’m gonna find Jupetta for sure!</b>

07:48.820 --> 07:50.200
<b>There it is!</b>

07:58.170 --> 07:58.830
<b>Hup.</b>

