<b>Ghost</b>

08:14.520 --> 08:19.440
<b>m 0 0 m 1575 960 l 1830 960 l 1830 1024.5 l 1575 1024.5</b>

08:21.730 --> 08:22.400
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:25.780 --> 08:27.820
<b>Hey— Why is it after me?!</b>

08:27.820 --> 08:30.410
<b>Kasumi! It wants your hair tie!</b>

08:30.410 --> 08:31.570
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:31.570 --> 08:33.030
<b>Hey!</b>

08:35.910 --> 08:38.080
<b>This girl...</b>

08:41.080 --> 08:44.460
<b>For now, I gotta stop it. 
 Pikachu, use Electroweb!</b>

08:49.260 --> 08:50.840
<b>Listen to me, Jupetta!</b>

08:50.840 --> 08:53.720
<b>We might be able to help—</b>

08:55.810 --> 08:58.640
<b>Wait! Gänger, follow it!</b>

09:30.050 --> 09:32.010
<b>You okay, Kasumi?</b>

09:32.010 --> 09:35.430
<b>Yeah... 
 I forgot it was after hearts.</b>

09:35.430 --> 09:36.680
<b>Hey!</b>

09:36.680 --> 09:37.640
<b>Takeshi!</b>

09:37.640 --> 09:39.020
<b>I figured it out!</b>

09:39.430 --> 09:40.480
<b>Huh?</b>

09:40.810 --> 09:42.230
<b>Look at this.</b>

09:42.850 --> 09:44.230
<b>What is it?</b>

09:44.610 --> 09:46.980
<b>Jupetta dropped this earlier.</b>

09:47.360 --> 09:49.400
<b>Hey, is it possible...</b>

09:49.400 --> 09:51.320
<b>...that <i>that’s</i> Jupetta?!</b>

09:51.320 --> 09:51.610
<b>Huh?</b>

09:53.530 --> 09:56.370
<b>Oh, that’s right! 
 Plush dolls become Jupetta!</b>

09:56.700 --> 10:00.120
<b>Look very closely at its head.</b>

10:00.120 --> 10:01.750
<b>Oh! A heart!</b>

10:01.750 --> 10:03.790
<b>It’s just like Kasumi’s!</b>

10:03.790 --> 10:05.130
<b>Is it?</b>

10:05.130 --> 10:11.130
<b>To sum it up, Jupetta is looking for 
 the hair tie it once wore as a plush doll.</b>

10:11.510 --> 10:13.880
<b>So that’s why 
 it’s after heart-shaped things...</b>

10:13.880 --> 10:15.140
<b>But why?</b>

10:15.140 --> 10:20.140
<b>Maybe that girl, its owner, 
 is the one who gave it the hair tie.</b>

10:20.140 --> 10:23.020
<b>It must be an important treasure 
 to Jupetta.</b>

10:23.020 --> 10:24.730
<b>A treasure...</b>

10:27.730 --> 10:29.860
<b>Gänger, where’s Jupetta?</b>

10:32.820 --> 10:34.280
<b>I see...</b>

10:38.200 --> 10:41.250
<b>Hmm, something’s bothering me...</b>

10:41.250 --> 10:42.750
<b>What is it?</b>

10:42.750 --> 10:44.790
<b>That’s what I can’t work out...</b>

10:45.540 --> 10:49.460
<b>Hey, Kasumi... think you could maybe 
 give that hair tie to Jupetta?</b>

10:49.460 --> 10:49.960
<b>Huh?</b>

10:49.960 --> 10:52.590
<b>I wanna make it happy.</b>

10:52.590 --> 10:53.720
<b>So, please!</b>

10:53.720 --> 10:55.180
<b>Fine with me.</b>

10:55.180 --> 10:57.550
<b>Actually, that was my plan, too.</b>

10:58.550 --> 10:59.720
<b>Thanks!</b>

11:19.450 --> 11:21.450
<b>Finished!</b>

11:23.700 --> 11:28.830
<b>Wow! You’re so cute! 
 It looks great on you, Gon-chan.</b>

11:28.830 --> 11:31.920
<b>I love you, Gon-chan!</b>

11:32.420 --> 11:35.050
<b>See you at our new house.</b>

11:35.050 --> 11:37.340
<b>Bye-bye, Gon-chan!</b>

11:48.310 --> 11:51.110
<b>Hey, the truck’s leaving! 
 Hurry up!</b>

13:03.550 --> 13:05.180
<b>It’s a ghost!</b>

13:46.180 --> 13:49.270
<b>You lost track 
 around here, Gänger?</b>

13:59.940 --> 14:01.740
<b>That place is suspicious.</b>

14:11.460 --> 14:13.040
<b>A pile of hearts!</b>

14:13.040 --> 14:14.920
<b>The things Jupetta took?!</b>

14:16.420 --> 14:18.380
<b>Jupetta, are you here?</b>

14:18.380 --> 14:21.420
<b>This photo’s yours, right? 
 We’re here to give it back!</b>

14:24.300 --> 14:26.050
<b>There it is!</b>

14:26.050 --> 14:29.640
<b>You want a heart-shaped 
 hair tie, right?</b>

14:29.640 --> 14:30.560
<b>Here.</b>

14:35.480 --> 14:36.900
<b>That should do it, right?</b>

14:45.990 --> 14:51.160
<b>Hey, Jupetta... 
 The girl in that photo is your owner, right?</b>

14:51.160 --> 14:53.370
<b>Don’t you wanna show her 
 your hair tie?</b>

14:54.210 --> 14:55.960
<b>Let’s go see her right now!</b>

15:06.640 --> 15:07.680
<b>Is that her?</b>

15:11.640 --> 15:13.810
<b>Huh? What?</b>

15:14.940 --> 15:18.190
<b>This is your plush doll. 
 It turned into a Jupetta.</b>

15:18.190 --> 15:19.820
<b>Plush doll?</b>

15:20.230 --> 15:21.820
<b>This is you, right?</b>

15:21.820 --> 15:24.240
<b>No, that’s not me.</b>

15:24.240 --> 15:25.820
<b>Huh? What?</b>

15:25.820 --> 15:28.240
<b>Hey, Jupetta... 
 Are you sure it’s this—?</b>

15:32.790 --> 15:33.290
<b>Huh?</b>

15:33.290 --> 15:34.620
<b>Stop right there!</b>

15:36.710 --> 15:38.710
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

15:39.590 --> 15:45.130
<b>Jupetta... Don’t tell me 
 you can’t remember that girl’s face...</b>

15:46.130 --> 15:47.470
<b>I knew it.</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:52.220
<b>What do we do...? 
 The photo’s not exactly clear, either.</b>

15:52.220 --> 15:56.810
<b>Huh? Hey, isn’t that green door 
 from that abandoned house?</b>

15:56.810 --> 15:59.230
<b>Oh, you’re right.</b>

15:59.860 --> 16:01.940
<b>Then this girl...</b>

16:01.940 --> 16:04.610
<b>...must’ve grown up by now.</b>

16:05.320 --> 16:08.990
<b>If we don’t know her age or her face, 
 we might not have any way to find her.</b>

16:11.490 --> 16:13.490
<b>No, it’ll work out somehow!</b>

16:13.950 --> 16:17.210
<b>If there’s no other choice, 
 we’ll just have to ask everyone!</b>

16:17.210 --> 16:17.870
<b>Huh?!</b>

16:39.520 --> 16:41.770
<b>I’m tired out...</b>

16:41.770 --> 16:44.900
<b>Maybe she moved 
 somewhere far away.</b>

16:46.940 --> 16:49.280
<b>Oh, I’m sorry, Jupetta.</b>

16:51.780 --> 16:53.410
<b>See you tomorrow!</b>

16:54.740 --> 16:56.790
<b>We’ll find her tomorrow.</b>

16:56.790 --> 16:57.660
<b>Yeah!</b>

17:03.170 --> 17:04.550
<b>Ah, Gänger!{delayed cut-in sound effect}</b>

17:07.010 --> 17:09.800
<b>He must be worried 
 about Jupetta.</b>

17:58.100 --> 18:00.230
<b>What is it now, Takeshi?</b>

