<b>It’s Ms. Joy!</b>

18:11.150 --> 18:12.700
<b>Y-Yes?</b>

18:12.700 --> 18:14.570
<b>Excuse you? 
 Learn when to give—</b>

18:14.570 --> 18:18.620
<b>That’s right! It’s Ms. Joy! 
 The girl in the photo!</b>

18:18.990 --> 18:19.750
<b>Huh?</b>

18:33.840 --> 18:35.800
<b>Ahh!</b>

18:35.800 --> 18:39.060
<b>Huh? What is it?</b>

18:40.970 --> 18:41.930
<b>Ah, Gänger!</b>

18:42.310 --> 18:43.560
<b>Where’s Jupetta?</b>

18:44.350 --> 18:46.690
<b>We found the girl!</b>

18:49.520 --> 18:51.530
<b>Huh? It didn’t go back 
