19:21.220 --> 19:24.390
<b>But I never imagined 
 it’d become a Jupetta...</b>

19:28.020 --> 19:29.770
<b>Is that it, Gänger?</b>

19:31.780 --> 19:32.900
<b>Kairyu!</b>

19:35.280 --> 19:39.280
<b>So all this time, 
